#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:6
msgid "Cloning Environments"
msgstr "克隆环境"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:10
msgid ""
"Cloning builds many simulation environments from a small set of reusable "
"asset prototypes. A :class:`~isaaclab.cloner.ClonePlan` describes which "
"assets belong in each environment. Physics and rendering use the same plan."
msgstr ""
"克隆通过少量可复用的资产原型，构建多个仿真环境。 :class:`~isaaclab.cloner.ClonePlan` "
"描述每个环境包含哪些资产，物理与渲染使用同一份计划。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:16
msgid "The cloning lifecycle"
msgstr "克隆生命周期"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:18
msgid "Scene construction follows one sequence:"
msgstr "场景构建遵循以下顺序："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:20
msgid ""
"Declare assets, sensors, physics, renderers, and visualizers in "
"configuration. Consumers register their required representations before "
"planning."
msgstr "在配置中声明资产、传感器、物理、渲染器和可视化器。各使用方在规划前注册所需的表示。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:22
msgid ""
"Build and publish the clone plan, then construct assets at the planned "
"prototype paths."
msgstr "构建并发布克隆计划，再在计划指定的原型路径上构建资产。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:23
msgid ""
"Replicate the declared prototypes through the required backends using that "
"same plan."
msgstr "通过所需后端，使用同一计划复制已声明的原型。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:24
msgid "Initialize consumers and bind them to the resulting native resources."
msgstr "初始化各使用方，并将它们绑定到生成的原生资源。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:26
msgid ""
"For tasks and demos, :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` handles "
"planning, asset construction, and replication. Given existing ``banana_cfg``"
" and ``franka_cfg`` asset configurations and an active simulation context "
"``sim``:"
msgstr ""
"对于任务和演示， :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` 负责规划、资产构建和复制。假设已有 "
"``banana_cfg`` 、 ``franka_cfg`` 资产配置，以及正在运行的仿真上下文 ``sim`` ："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:43
msgid ""
"This creates sixteen environments, each with one banana and one Franka. "
"Declare cameras alongside the assets so they participate in the same "
"lifecycle. For varying assets across environments, see "
":doc:`multi_asset_spawning`."
msgstr ""
"这会创建十六个环境，每个包含一个香蕉和一个 Franka。相机应与资产一同声明，以参与相同的生命周期。不同环境使用不同资产的方式见 "
":doc:`multi_asset_spawning` 。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:49
msgid "Walking through a ClonePlan"
msgstr "理解 ClonePlan"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:51
msgid ""
"An **asset prototype** is one reusable asset definition. A **world "
"prototype** is a composition of those assets. For example, two asset "
"prototypes can describe four different world prototypes:"
msgstr "**资产原型** 是一份可复用的资产定义； **世界原型** 是这些资产的一种组合。例如，两个资产原型可描述四种不同的世界原型："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:69
msgid ""
"Repeating an asset index creates another instance, not another prototype "
"definition. With the default equal weights and sequential allocation, each "
"world prototype is used by four of the sixteen destination worlds."
msgstr "重复一个资产索引会创建另一个实例，而不是新增原型定义。使用默认等权重和顺序分配时，十六个目标世界中，每个世界原型对应四个世界。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:73
msgid "``ClonePlan`` keeps four things:"
msgstr "``ClonePlan`` 保存四类内容："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:75
msgid "``asset_cfgs``: the asset definitions, stored once."
msgstr "``asset_cfgs`` ：资产定义，只存储一次。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:76
msgid "``topology``: numeric asset membership and world-prototype selection."
msgstr "``topology`` ：以数值表示的资产成员关系和世界原型选择。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:77
msgid ""
"``env_template``: the destination naming template, with one ``{}`` slot for "
"the world ID."
msgstr "``env_template`` ：目标名称模板，其中一个 ``{}`` 占位符用于世界 ID。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:78
msgid ""
"``positions``: optional destination-world origins [m], separate from "
"topology."
msgstr "``positions`` ：可选的目标世界原点 [m]，与拓扑分开存储。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:80
msgid "The example's topology is stored as flat arrays:"
msgstr "本例的拓扑以一维数组存储："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:89
msgid ""
"``world_prototype_starts`` separates the asset lists. Its first slice "
"belongs to the shared world ``-1``; the leading ``[0, 0]`` means there are "
"no shared assets. For a shared ground, append its cfg to ``asset_cfgs`` and "
"pass ``shared_assets=(2,)``. That asset is instantiated once, outside the "
"replicated environments."
msgstr ""
"``world_prototype_starts`` 分隔各资产列表。其第一个切片属于共享世界 ``-1`` ；开头的 ``[0, 0]`` "
"表示没有共享资产。如果需要共享地面，将其配置追加到 ``asset_cfgs`` ，并传入 ``shared_assets=(2,)`` "
"。该资产只实例化一次，位于复制出的环境之外。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:94
msgid ""
"``world_prototype_layout`` selects a prototype for each destination world: "
"worlds 0–3 use prototype 0, worlds 4–7 use prototype 1, and so on. Optional "
"``weights`` change how worlds are distributed among prototypes."
msgstr ""
"``world_prototype_layout`` 为每个目标世界选择原型：世界 0–3 使用原型 0，世界 4–7 使用原型 1，依此类推。可选的 "
"``weights`` 改变世界在各原型间的分配比例。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:98
msgid ""
"``make_clone_plan`` only describes the scene; it does not spawn or replicate"
" assets. ``InteractiveScene`` prepares and executes the plan as part of "
"scene construction. Only declared asset subtrees participate, not undeclared"
" siblings found on the stage."
msgstr ""
"``make_clone_plan`` 只描述场景，不生成或复制资产。 ``InteractiveScene`` "
"在构建场景时准备并执行该计划。只有已声明的资产子树参与，舞台上未声明的同级节点不参与。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:104
msgid "Explicit cloning for tests and tools"
msgstr "测试与工具中的显式克隆"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:106
msgid ""
"Without ``InteractiveScene``, a homogeneous scene can use the same lifecycle"
" explicitly. Set the asset paths to ``{ENV_REGEX_NS}/Banana`` and "
"``{ENV_REGEX_NS}/Franka``, then plan before constructing them:"
msgstr ""
"不使用 ``InteractiveScene`` 时，同构场景也可显式执行同一生命周期。将资产路径设为 "
"``{ENV_REGEX_NS}/Banana`` 和 ``{ENV_REGEX_NS}/Franka`` ，然后在构建资产前进行规划："

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:120
msgid ""
"Pass a flat collection of asset and sensor cfgs, including shared assets "
"such as ground and lights. Prefer ``InteractiveScene`` for maintained tasks "
"and demos; it also handles backend-specific setup such as PhysX collision "
"filtering."
msgstr ""
"传入一维的资产与传感器配置集合，其中也包括地面、灯光等共享资产。对于持续维护的任务和演示，优先使用 ``InteractiveScene`` "
"，它还会处理 PhysX 碰撞过滤等后端专用设置。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:124
msgid ""
"Setting ``replicate_physics=False`` skips the active physics replication "
"context. Other declared contexts still run, including USD replication when "
"configured, so they can create the per-environment prims without replicating"
" the physics model. The physics backend can then parse those prims "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``replicate_physics=False`` 会跳过当前物理复制上下文。其他已声明的上下文仍会运行，包括已配置的 USD "
"复制，因此它们可创建各环境的 prim，而不复制物理模型。之后，物理后端可分别解析这些 prim。"

#: source/how-to/cloning.rst:129
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`cloner API reference <../api/lab/isaaclab.cloner>` for "
"individual functions, topology queries, and path utilities."
msgstr "各函数、拓扑查询及路径工具见 :doc:`克隆器 API 参考 <../api/lab/isaaclab.cloner>` 。"
